SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — 20–25 min flat walk only (no jogging) a
 t fully conversationa
DESCRIPTION:20–25 min flat walk only (no jogging) at fully conversational
  effort\; HR target ≤120 bpm. If body battery on waking is below 40\, ta
 ke full rest instead. Postpone any swimming to Tuesday when fatigue can be
  better assessed.\n\nReason: Athlete self-reported still being sick on 15 
 August\; body battery is 58/16 today suggesting partial recovery but not s
 ufficient for even a jog-test — a conservative walk-only approach protec
 ts against relapse one day into the return.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
