SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Shorten to 30–40 min easy spin indoors 
 at 100–120W (well bel
DESCRIPTION:Shorten to 30–40 min easy spin indoors at 100–120W (well be
 low Z2 floor)\; HR cap 130 bpm. Cancel if morning body battery is below 40
  or any illness symptoms remain.\n\nReason: Athlete is only 3 days into re
 turn from ~3.5 weeks of illness\; 90 min at Z2 power is premature and risk
 s setback — a short easy spin confirms bike tolerance without imposing m
 eaningful training stress.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
