SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Cap at 45 min at 100–120W with strict H
 R ≤130 bpm\; if the Tu
DESCRIPTION:Cap at 45 min at 100–120W with strict HR ≤130 bpm\; if the 
 Tuesday bike session went well and body battery on Saturday morning is ≥
 55\, extend to 60 min only. Skip entirely and replace with a 30 min walk i
 f battery is below 40.\n\nReason: With only one short bike session (Tuesda
 y) between now and Saturday\, jumping straight to 60 min would be a large 
 single-step load increase for an athlete coming off prolonged illness — 
 a conditional extension protects the return.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
