SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Replace with 35–45 min easy jog at 6:45
 –7:15/km (HR ≤135 bpm
DESCRIPTION:Replace with 35–45 min easy jog at 6:45–7:15/km (HR ≤135 
 bpm)\; stop early if HR drifts above 140 or any symptom returns. 18.5km is
  not achievable safely this week after 3.5 weeks off with illness.\n\nReas
 on: Athlete self-reported still sick on 15 August — attempting an 18.5km
  long run just 8 days later would be a severe overreach and risks both rel
 apse and injury\; a short easy jog re-establishes the running pattern with
 out imposing unmanageable load.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
