SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Retain as the week's key swim session bu
 t adjust to 60 min w
DESCRIPTION:Retain as the week's key swim session but adjust to 60 min with
  a structured aerobic set (e.g. 400m warm-up + 4×500m at 2:25–2:30/100m
  with 30 sec rest + 200m cool-down ≈ 2\,800m)\; drop the race-simulation
  intensity label — athlete will only be ~10 days into return and abroad.
 \n\nReason: Athlete will be abroad (self-reported week of 24 Aug) and only
  ~10 days into post-illness return\; a structured aerobic swim at realisti
 c volume still builds Half Oceanman swim fitness without the injury risk o
 f a full race-simulation effort.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
