 his directly serves the Half Oceanman 5\,000m build. If a bike is confirme
 d available\, keep the 60 min easy ride at ≤130W and skip the added even
 ing swim to avoid excessive daily load.\n\nReason: Athlete self-reported b
 eing abroad this week and bike access is uncertain\; prioritising an addit
 ional swim session over a potentially unavailable ride better serves the n
